content.text:
The root cause is payment, a pod that restarted at the start of the incident and never resumed serving. Checkout's calls to it fail immediately, and that failure reaches the user through frontend and frontend-proxy as HTTP 500s on checkout requests.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "payment",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT 'normal' p, min(value) mn, max(value) mx FROM normal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'payment%' AND metric='k8s.container.restarts' UNION ALL SELECT 'abnormal', min(value), max(value) FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'payment%' AND metric='k8s.container.restarts'",
          "claim": "Payment container restart counter was 0 in the normal period and 1 during the abnormal period."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT time, round(value/1e6,2) mem_mb FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'payment%' AND metric='container.memory.usage' ORDER BY time LIMIT 10",
          "claim": "Payment memory fell from about 127 MB to about 0.6 MB at the start of the window, consistent with a process restart that did not recover its workload."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT (SELECT count(*) FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='payment') normal_payment_spans, (SELECT count(*) FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='payment') abnormal_payment_spans",
          "claim": "Payment emitted 26 spans in the normal period and none in the abnormal period."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,2) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name='oteldemo.PaymentService/Charge' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Checkout's PaymentService/Charge calls all error out in about 0.02 ms, with no successful Charge spans in the abnormal window."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "payment",
      "to": "checkout",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name IN ('oteldemo.CheckoutService/PlaceOrder','oteldemo.PaymentService/Charge') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Checkout's PlaceOrder server spans error alongside every failed Charge call to payment (7 each)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "checkout",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name IN ('grpc.oteldemo.CheckoutService/PlaceOrder','POST /api/checkout') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Frontend's PlaceOrder client calls and POST /api/checkout server spans all return Error with HTTP 500, 7 each."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "frontend",
      "to": "frontend-proxy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend-proxy' AND span_name='ingress' AND attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "Frontend-proxy ingress returns 500 for 28 requests in the abnormal window, against 19 in the normal period."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

